  <item>
    <title>184 南果梨书店的来路与去路 feat. 丢丢&amp;李泽</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b085d4e640854f0e6080758</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b085d4e640854f0e6080758</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>11月27日上午11时，在沈阳南市场地铁站八卦街附近，诞生了一家新的独立书店——南果梨书店。店主是我的一对儿情侣朋友、小破播客的老嘉宾听友。在图书市场萧条的当下，为啥还有新的独立书店开业？图书、文创、饮品、活动——独立书店的灵魂还剩多少？营利、成本、回本，如何在现实里打造自己的梦想？这期播客我们都展开讲讲。</span></p><p><span>Timeline</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 南果梨书店法人介绍书店的缘起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 怎么想做读书会的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 沈阳独立书店各有什么特点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 南果梨书店文创专注于在地文化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 未来举办多种线下活动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 过往工作都给书店带来了哪些灵感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 丢丢开发了独立书店库存管理系统</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2469">41:09</a> 两个人开书店后有哪些成长</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2832">47:12</a> 片尾《Good Parts》By LE SSERAFIM</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1Iy4iMEYBwj3Iu0K-JOPVDWdkK.JPG"><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><p><span>南果梨书店小红书：nanguopearbooks</span></p><p><span>南果梨推荐新书小红书：nanguopear</span></p><p><span>丢丢小红书：diudiuqi</span></p><p><span>李泽即刻：李泽_yEny</span></p><p><span>主播即刻&amp;小红书：Leon_FunTalk</span></p><p><span>加主播微信入听友群：FunTalk2021</span></p><p><span>邮箱：FunTalk2021@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
