  <item>
    <title>182 从演讲台到面试场：如何“聊”进世界名校 feat. Yiyi</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b01c92577e5b18a3330bf27</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b01c92577e5b18a3330bf27</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客Leon邀请到Toastmasters老友、资深留学面试辅导导师Yiyi (VX: Yiyi__Fighting__)，聊聊从演讲台跨界到名校面试场的奇妙之旅。从硬核的备考策略，到镜头前打光穿搭的细节拿捏，Yiyi带你拆解名校面试的底层逻辑。最后，还有她关于“优秀”定义的重新思考与独家“回血”秘籍。无论你是准留学生还是表达爱好者，这期内容都不容错过！</span></p><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 如何入行留学面试辅导老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 如何克服学术与日常表达差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> 如何用准备素材接住意外之问</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 如何平衡“有准备”和“背诵感”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 如何应对紧张状态下大脑一片空白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 面试官们到底寻找什么样的学生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> 如何“撬开”不善言辞的面试者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 外在的表现能加分多少</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> AI有威胁到面试辅导行业吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 面试辅导这份工作成就感有多少</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> Yiyi对“优秀”的再定义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> Yiyi的回血秘籍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> 片尾《The Long Way Home》 By Shoffy</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1nzHwKyZTIINWYA3pNIX2Ou2u-.JPG"><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><p><span>嘉宾：Yiyi（VX: Yiyi__Fighting__)</span></p><p><span>主播即刻&amp;小红书：Leon_FunTalk</span></p><p><span>加主播微信入听友群：FunTalk2021</span></p><p><span>邮箱：FunTalk2021@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
