  <item>
    <title>181 港乐夜航：从旧时光到新声浪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab520b2195d838e2ae9c533</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab520b2195d838e2ae9c533</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:12:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我挑了15首过去半年里反复听过的粤语歌。歌单没有严格按照发行年份排列，而是大体顺着不同的港乐世代，从我们熟悉的旧时光出发，慢慢走进千禧年之后更加都市、更加私人化的表达，再一路听到今天香港乐坛年轻一代的声音。中间也会有一些有趣的相遇：新的声音重新唱起旧时代的作品，几十年前的问题，又被今天的人重新问了一遍。如果你正在回家的路上，在车里、在地铁上、一个人散步，或者房间已经关了灯，只剩耳机里还有声音——那就一起听一会儿。这一晚，我们从旧时光启程，慢慢驶向今天的新声浪。</span></p><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">00:02:14</a> 一枝花 By 彭羚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">00:07:03</a> 如梦初醒 By 彭羚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">00:11:52</a> 当年情 By 张国荣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">00:16:51</a> 昨迟人 By 许志安</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">00:22:06</a> 最佳损友 By 陈奕迅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">00:26:57</a> 情深说话未曾讲 By 卫兰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">00:31:32</a> 我会等（粤语版） By 李若彤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">00:35:07</a> 许延铿 By 追忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">00:40:50</a> 在最好的时间做最好的你 By 冯允谦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">00:45:28</a> 冬天一个游 By Gordon Flanders 王骏杨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3037">00:50:37</a> 用背脊唱情歌 By Gareth T. 汤令山</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">00:54:56</a> 我很小朋友 By Gareth T. 汤令山</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3514">00:58:34</a> 大亨 By 林家谦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3771">01:02:51</a> 记得 By 林家谦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4137">01:08:57</a> 普渡众生 By 林家谦</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjisGnSIICfKOkOvwnH63W7vmg1s.jpg"><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><p><span>主播即刻&amp;小红书：Leon_FunTalk</span></p><p><span>加主播微信入听友群：FunTalk2021</span></p><p><span>邮箱：FunTalk2021@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
