  <item>
    <title>179 随联合国团队在阿富汗出差有着怎样的体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8b16941352af56ff3ac3a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8b16941352af56ff3ac3a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 19:43:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天我要跟各位分享的是在7月初随联合国难民署和发展署的两位一把手出差的采访经历。这是阿富汗塔利班执政以来，第一次同时迎接两位联合国副秘书长级别高官的到访，我所在的媒体也是仅有两家被邀请的随团国际媒体之一，机会难得。更多相关图片可前往主播小红书账号（Leon_FunTalk）查看。</span></p><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 出差缘由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">05:56</a> 落地马扎里沙里夫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 采访开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 返程搭乘联合国航班</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> 片尾《You broke me first》By Tate McRae</span></p><p><strong><span>联合国难民署和发展署的负责人在接受媒体采访</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqDOXAggSMlWlrTrNgmTAOdxI4wY.jpeg"><p><strong><span>忙碌中的干果厂返乡难民女工</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6rc2GbNPhoLdgIuc4-u3yR4leb.jpeg"><p><strong><span>手工地毯坊里的返乡难民女工</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHXbAmmSr3-551v5NYDdb6xhUyg.jpeg"><p><strong><span>联合国人道主义空运服务处航班</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbZyX_Ll2NiFhGkM8OBHNixuiTE.jpg"><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><p><span>主播即刻&amp;小红书：Leon_FunTalk</span></p><p><span>加主播微信入听友群：FunTalk2021</span></p><p><span>邮箱：FunTalk2021@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
