  <item>
    <title>174 误解与边界：她的地陪故事 feat. 77</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697674b3ef1cf272a76b16b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697674b3ef1cf272a76b16b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾是我在此前任期假回到沈阳后第二周在小红书上找到的一位嘉宾，也是主播第一次付费给陌生嘉宾，原因无他，只是满足包括我在内的一些人对好看又有趣的“地陪女孩”的好奇。聊天过后，我越发相信某种偏见式的武断——日本社会的今天就是中国社会的明天，特别是一些非传统、合法但擦边的情感关系和陪伴在城市生活里会愈发展现。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 收费标准和服务项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 嘉宾自我优势的分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 地陪客户有奇葩么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 嘉宾此前的直播兼职经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2196">36:36</a> 某地陪女孩被带到泰国缅甸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a> 嘉宾对水瓶男的精准分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> “不会进一步发展”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 恋爱脑不会把男人当事业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">01:00:05</a> 片尾《索拉里斯星》 &nbsp;By 昨夜派对</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpvetuVYAxJtp8_nFOPDrBCbrDwV.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播即刻&amp;小红书：Leon_FunTalk</span></p><span></span><p><span>加主播微信入听友群：FunTalk2021</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：FunTalk2021@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
