    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《老友记》系列我们邀请到了听友们喜闻乐见的资深嘉宾夕颜，聊聊2025年下半年她集中看了的12场演唱会，非常“吊诡”的是此前她听了很多音乐会和歌舞剧但确实是第一次踏入演唱会这个领域。再过几个月她就要远赴加拿大了，不知道下次相见在何时，大家且听且珍惜。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 瘦身后的夕颜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 孙燕姿时隔十年开演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 所有票都是原价抢票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 指点迷津小红书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 超出预期的王心凌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 五月天歌迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a> 王力宏复出后的演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 新世代艺人的窘境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 一个富有的躺平朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">59:30</a> 夕颜今年的”贵饭“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4475">01:14:35</a> 片尾《我要变好看》 By 阿晗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frt0xyF2UZe5wtVLIDJrtnu2mOmW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播即刻&amp;小红书：Leon_FunTalk</span></p><span></span><p><span>加主播微信入听友群：FunTalk2021</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：FunTalk2021@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
