    <title>169 继续环球旅行，走向远方与自己 feat. 粤姐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694e5a872db086f89717b642</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694e5a872db086f89717b642</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 10:02:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《老友记》系列嘉宾粤姐在过去的半年踏足了5个海外国家和国内的15个城市，在播客上线之际，她刚落地挪威继续旅行。与其他旅行博主不同的是，她通过桥牌、潜水与支教和这个世界发生着千丝万缕的联系。</span></p><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 回归桥牌圈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 粤姐接连不断的好运气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 外国人对中国生肖的迷思</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 不同深度的潜水体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 朝圣之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 重访疫情期间的滞留地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a> 重回大凉山支教地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">48:07</a> 粤姐与儿子：眼不见心不烦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3609">01:00:09</a> 中年人的悲歌：手机字号调大了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3813">01:03:33</a> 《这世界怎么了》 By 阿肆</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVxib01mjAGMkiNQuwaqiqRLdFv.jpeg"></figure><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><p><span>粤姐视频号：sph7qtC9ymsXJsF</span></p><p><span>主播即刻&amp;小红书：Leon_FunTalk</span></p><p><span>加主播微信入听友群：FunTalk2021</span></p><p><span>邮箱：FunTalk2021@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
